## Description

Join us for Ultralytics Live Session 20, where we’ll dive into our latest product launch  - Ultralytics YOLO26. In this session, Ultralytics’ Founder and CEO Glenn Jocher and Senior Machine Learning Engineer Jing Qiu will take a deep dive into the newest advancements in computer vision intelligence. 

Ultralytics YOLO26 represents the next generation of real-time object detection models, engineered from the ground up for easy integrations on edge and low-power devices. Featuring a streamlined architecture that removes unnecessary complexity while introducing targeted innovations, YOLO26 delivers faster, lighter, and more accessible model deployment. The result is a highly practical model family that achieves improved small-object accuracy, seamless deployment, and up to 43% faster CPU inference, making YOLO26 one of the most deployable YOLO models to date.

Agenda for the ULS:
✅ Introduction to Ultralytics YOLO26
✅ Live Demo
✅ Live Q&A

